      "sourceTextSha256": "d31c995ea540727f8a59f789242648e4cc46f5de4dcac2a25a873c4350af2524",
      "text": "Day 17 · City tour of Cusco with an English-speaking guide, including the Qorikancha (Temple of the Sun), where the Incas held their main festival, the winter solstice. Continue to four nearby sites: the temple of Q’enqo, the red fortress of Puka Pukara, Tambomachay, centre of the Inca worship of water, and the vast complex of Sacsayhuamán, with its temples, fortress, towers and channels built of colossal boulders. Transfer to Lima.",
